{
  "name": "Daily UK Public Tenders (\u00a3100k+) to Google Sheets and Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily UK Public Tenders (\u00a3100k+) to Google Sheets and Slack\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow runs every day at 8 AM UTC to extract UK public procurement tenders worth \u00a3100k or more across Find a Tender, Contracts Finder, and Public Contracts Scotland using the Apify Actor `jamestyas/uk-public-procurement-ocds-enricher`.\n\nIt removes duplicate notices by canonical OCID, then logs new opportunities to Google Sheets and posts alert cards to Slack in parallel.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n1. **Apify Account & API Token**:\n   Create a free Apify account at `https://apify.com/jamestyas/uk-public-procurement-ocds-enricher` (includes $5 in free monthly compute, covering daily 24h delta runs).\n   Copy your API token from Console -> Settings -> Integrations and add an Apify credential in n8n.\n2. **Google Sheets**:\n   Connect Google Sheets credentials. In your spreadsheet, ensure tab `Procurement Tenders` has headers in Row 1: `OCID`, `Estimated Value (GBP)`, `Notice Title`, `Authority Name`, `Project Scope & Description`, `Submission Deadline`, `Sector / CPV Codes`, `Published Date`, `Source Portal`, `Buyer Region`.\n3. **Slack (Optional)**:\n   Connect Slack credentials and select your `#tenders` channel (or leave disabled if only logging to Sheets).\n4. **Schedule Trigger**:\n   Set to run daily at 8:00 AM UTC.\n\n### Customisation\n\nAdjust the Apify Actor input JSON to filter specific CPV sector codes (e.g. `\"cpv_codes\": [\"72000000\"]` for IT services) or adjust the minimum threshold (`\"min_value_gbp\": 100000`).",
        "width": 500,
        "height": 780
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -368,
        -32
      ],
      "id": "1681a9f2-76b6-4a04-a664-c52b91993bbb",
      "name": "Documentation & Setup Guide"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Schedule tender collection\n\nStarts the workflow daily at 8 AM UTC and executes the Apify procurement actor to extract UK tender opportunities >= \u00a3100k.",
        "width": 432,
        "height": 336,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        192,
        144
      ],
      "id": "a8a9b6aa-ddc3-4d04-8306-f5cb4e1b8b61",
      "name": "Collection Cluster"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Deduplicate tender records\n\nFilters fetched items to discard previously processed notices using the canonical OCID identifier.",
        "width": 240,
        "height": 464,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        672,
        16
      ],
      "id": "9595ee6c-0e2a-4eaa-9141-502baa171177",
      "name": "Deduplication Cluster"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Log and notify\n\nLogs new tenders with full scope descriptions to Google Sheets and sends alert cards to Slack in parallel.",
        "width": 260,
        "height": 608,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        960,
        -32
      ],
      "id": "b7fb4014-4e8e-4551-b3f1-dfe232dde1c7",
      "name": "Output Cluster"
    },
    {
      "id": "1e7f3b8a-9c42-4b31-8692-0b1a2c3d4e5f",
      "name": "When Daily at 8 AM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        240,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "2b8c4d9e-0a53-4c42-9703-1c2b3d4e5f6a",
      "name": "Run Daily Procurement Actor",
      "type": "@apify/n8n-nodes-apify.apify",
      "position": [
        480,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "actorId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "jamestyas/uk-public-procurement-ocds-enricher"
        },
        "resource": "Actors",
        "operation": "Run actor and get dataset",
        "actorSource": "recentlyUsed",
        "actorInputMode": "json",
        "customBody": "{\n  \"sources\": [\n    \"find_a_tender\",\n    \"contracts_finder\",\n    \"public_contracts_scotland\"\n  ],\n  \"notice_type\": \"tender\",\n  \"min_value_gbp\": 100000,\n  \"enrich_companies_house\": true,\n  \"max_records\": 100\n}"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "apifyApi": {
          "id": "apify_account_credential",
          "name": "Apify account"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "3c9d5e0f-1b64-4d53-a814-2d3c4e5f6a7b",
      "name": "Deduplicate by OCID",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "position": [
        720,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "logic": "removeItemsWithAlreadySeenKeyValues",
        "operation": "removeItemsSeenInPreviousExecutions",
        "dedupeValue": "={{ $json.ocid }}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "4d0e6f1a-2c75-4e64-b925-3e4d5f6a7b8c",
      "name": "Append Tenders to Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        1008,
        224
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Procurement Tenders"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "OCID": "={{ $json.ocid }}",
            "Estimated Value (GBP)": "={{ $json.tender_value_gbp ? '\u00a3' + Number($json.tender_value_gbp).toLocaleString('en-GB') : 'N/A' }}",
            "Notice Title": "={{ $json.title }}",
            "Authority Name": "={{ $json.buyer_name }}",
            "Project Scope & Description": "={{ $json.description || 'No description provided' }}",
            "Submission Deadline": "={{ $json.deadline_date ? $json.deadline_date.replace('T', ' ').replace('.000Z', ' UTC') : 'Unspecified' }}",
            "Sector / CPV Codes": "={{ $json.cpv_codes ? $json.cpv_codes.join(', ') : 'N/A' }}",
            "Published Date": "={{ $json.published_date }}",
            "Source Portal": "={{ $json.source_platform }}",
            "Buyer Region": "={{ $json.buyer_region || 'National' }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "google_sheets_credential",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.5
    },
    {
      "id": "5e1f7a2b-3d86-4f75-ca36-4f5e6a7b8c9d",
      "name": "Post Tender Alerts to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "position": [
        1008,
        416
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "channel": "#uk-tender-alerts",
        "text": "=\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f New UK Tender (\u00a3100k+): {{ $json.title }} (\u00a3{{ Number($json.tender_value_gbp).toLocaleString('en-GB') }} GBP)",
        "otherOptions": {
          "includeLinkToWorkflow": false
        },
        "blocksUi": {
          "blocksValues": [
            {
              "type": "header",
              "text": {
                "type": "plain_text",
                "text": "\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f High-Value UK Public Tender (\u00a3100k+)"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "section",
              "text": {
                "type": "mrkdwn",
                "text": "=*Title:*\n{{ $json.title }}\n\n*Contracting Authority:*\n{{ $json.buyer_name }} ({{ $json.buyer_region || 'National' }})"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "section",
              "fields": [
                {
                  "type": "mrkdwn",
                  "text": "*Estimated Value:*\n\u00a3{{ Number($json.tender_value_gbp).toLocaleString('en-GB') }} GBP"
                },
                {
                  "type": "mrkdwn",
                  "text": "*Submission Deadline:*\n{{ $json.deadline_date ? new Date($json.deadline_date).toUTCString() : 'Unspecified' }}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "mrkdwn",
                  "text": "*Source Platform:*\n{{ $json.source_platform.toUpperCase() }}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "mrkdwn",
                  "text": "*OCID Reference:*\n`{{ $json.ocid }}`"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "divider"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "slack_credential",
          "name": "Slack account"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "When Daily at 8 AM": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Run Daily Procurement Actor",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Run Daily Procurement Actor": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Deduplicate by OCID",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Deduplicate by OCID": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Append Tenders to Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Post Tender Alerts to Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}